        "custom": "Pokémon"
      },
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>O Pokémon Tartaruguinha. Após nascer, as costas de Squirtle incham e endurecem até formar uma carapaça. Ele também dispara uma espuma poderosa pela boca. Sua carapaça é macia logo após o nascimento, mas rapidamente se torna tão resistente que faz até um dedo ricochetear ao pressioná-la.</p><p><strong>SR:</strong> 1/2 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Nível Mínimo Encontrado:</strong> 1 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Grupo de Ovos:</strong> Monstro, Água 1 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Gênero:</strong> 88% M / 12% F &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Estágio Evolutivo:</strong> 1/3</p><p><strong>Evolução:</strong> Squirtle pode evoluir para Wartortle no nível 6 ou superior. Quando evolui, seus pontos de vida aumentam no dobro do seu nível.</p><h3>Moves por Nível</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Nível</th><th>Moves adquiridos</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style='text-align:center'>1</td><td>Tackle</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>2</td><td>Tail Whip</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>3</td><td>Water Gun</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>4</td><td>Withdraw</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>5</td><td>Bubble</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>6</td><td>Bite</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>7</td><td>Rapid Spin</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>8</td><td>Protect</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>9</td><td>Shell Smash, Water Pulse</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>10</td><td>Aqua Tail</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>11</td><td>Skull Bash</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>12</td><td>Iron Defense, Wave Crash</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>13</td><td>Rain Dance</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>14</td><td>Hydro Pump</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>TMs</h3><p>Aqua Tail, Attract, Blizzard, Body Slam, Brick Break, Brine, Chilling Water, Confide, Dig, Dive, Double Team, Double-Edge, Dragon Pulse, Endure, Facade, False Swipe, Fling, Flip Turn, Focus Punch, Frustration, Gyro Ball, Hail, Haze, Helping Hand, Hidden Power, Hydro Pump, Ice Beam, Ice Punch, Ice Spinner, Icy Wind, Iron Defense, Iron Tail, Liquidation, Mega Kick, Mega Punch, Mud Shot, Muddy Water, Protect, Rain Dance, Rest, Return, Rock Tomb, Round, Scald, Sleep Talk, Snore, Substitute, Surf, Swagger, Take Down, Tera Blast, Toxic, Water Pledge, Water Pulse, Waterfall, Weather Ball, Whirlpool, Work Up, Zen Headbutt</p><h3>Egg Moves</h3><p>Aqua Jet, Aqua Ring, Aura Sphere, Brine, Dragon Pulse, Fake Out, Flail, Foresight, Haze, Life Dew, Mirror Coat, Mist, Mud Sport, Muddy Water, Refresh, Water Spout, Yawn</p>",
